# RobustIDPS.ai XDP block list. One IPv4/IPv6 CIDR or bare address per line.
# Lines starting with # are ignored; blank lines are ignored.
#
# To apply changes without dropping the BPF map:
#   sudo systemctl reload-or-restart robustidps-xdp
#
# To inspect the running BPF map directly:
#   sudo bpftool map dump name blocked_v4
#   sudo bpftool map dump name blocked_v6
#
# Example entries (commented out):
# 203.0.113.0/24        # RFC 5737 documentation block (test-net-3)
# 198.51.100.42         # RFC 5737 example host
# 2001:db8::/32         # RFC 3849 documentation IPv6 block
